\begin{proof}
  \leanok
  Apply the refinement clause of \ref{def:divisorAdaptation} at the piece \(j\) and at the
  point \(y := z\) itself. The point \(z\) lies in \(P_j\) and in \(\mathcal U(z)\), hence
